{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e17-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "学会对自己好一点  (Learning to Be Kinder to Himself)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Later at Chun Yuqiao's apartment, takeout arrives as Kaiwen fusses over his boss refusing to rest properly in bed. Listen to their Mandarin banter.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的外卖送到了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "跟着你就只能吃外卖，我们能不来照顾你吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们说话轻点，老大正在里面休息呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有一些工作上的事得跟你交代一下，别让老大听见，来这边说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "别动，快躺好！既然选择回家养病，你就好好养着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们能不能自然一点？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你穿着外面的衣服躺床上，能自然吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "怎么样，我看这架势，你跟小谷处得挺不错啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你在这儿胡说八道什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "之前我磨破了嘴皮子你就是不听，非要把自己搞成这样才高兴。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "说了多少年了，你能不能学着对自己好一点，无论是工作还是感情？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的外卖送到了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My takeout delivery just arrived.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "跟着你就只能吃外卖，我们能不来照顾你吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Left with her, all you get to eat is takeout—how could we not come check on you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们说话轻点，老大正在里面休息呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Keep your voices down; the boss is resting inside.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有一些工作上的事得跟你交代一下，别让老大听见，来这边说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have a few work matters to go over with you out of earshot of the boss—let us talk over here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "别动，快躺好！既然选择回家养病，你就好好养着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not move—lie back down! Since you chose to recuperate at home, rest properly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们能不能自然一点？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could you all act a little more natural?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你穿着外面的衣服躺床上，能自然吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lying in bed wearing street clothes—how is that natural?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "怎么样，我看这架势，你跟小谷处得挺不错啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So how is it going—judging by the look of things, you and Xiaogu are getting along great?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你在这儿胡说八道什么呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What nonsense are you spouting in here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "之前我磨破了嘴皮子你就是不听，非要把自己搞成这样才高兴。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Earlier I talked myself hoarse and you refused to listen, insisting on running yourself into the ground.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "说了多少年了，你能不能学着对自己好一点，无论是工作还是感情？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After all these years of me saying it, could you learn to be kinder to yourself in both work and romance?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我的外卖送到了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "跟着你就只能吃外卖，我们能不来照顾你吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
